<h2 local-id=3D"88903710d2e9" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-2.ProjectOverview">2. Project Overview</h2>
<p local-id=3D"86a9ea353cca">The Summarisation Stage 3 &amp; Stage 5 Dashbo=
ard will provide operational and business visibility into AI- assisted deci=
sioning, mitigation identification, letter generation, agent intervention, =
and custom mitigation activity.</p>
<p local-id=3D"08db1649fc18">The dashboard will be hosted in the <strong>ex=
isting Notice IQ environment</strong>, under the <strong>Summarisation Orga=
nisation</strong>, where existing dashboards or reporting capabilities for =
<strong>Stages 1, 2, and 4</strong> are already available.</p>
<p local-id=3D"677eaee9b982">The dashboard is intended to help business, op=
erations, QA, and template governance teams monitor:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"36eeabbe-38db-41b1-a576-063187599ce6">
<li local-id=3D"60972d22-d716-48fd-b5bc-df9872cc28c4">
<p local-id=3D"a482cc366d33">how many cases are reviewed,</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9c34d77e-ecc6-46bd-92a6-9323ec2b0dc3">
<p local-id=3D"edb29494c704">whether mitigations are found in policy/templa=
tes,</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"49733adc-aba9-46ba-9b1d-cc5a944bc87b">
<p local-id=3D"ed3557b9c40b">bot decision outcomes,</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ffebc77-ae86-4ee5-8224-c8b0ee4a6700">
<p local-id=3D"edc32fdc1624">Amber decision reasons,</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c1541560-c275-4b8a-a09a-c20608561645">
<p local-id=3D"36a6dfdea499">letter amendment activity,</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"87b15c29-da90-4197-9f6b-88b61e418a8a">
<p local-id=3D"cf57ea618c18">agent- level case activity,</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4a427e19-2df1-4265-aa79-0191cce3c6ae">
<p local-id=3D"812117277569">PCN- level traceability,</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ab209465-51a1-4643-8c26-783f212f4a81">
<p local-id=3D"c8f3d929d849">contravention- level trends,</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"66d09c8f-c828-416f-84e9-c883e814cc47">
<p local-id=3D"e5731e0495a7">and custom mitigation inputs requiring busines=
s/template review.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"b91d50d4467b" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-3.BusinessObjective">3. Business Objective</h2>
<p local-id=3D"727a265f3cff">The objective of the Stage 3 &amp; Stage 5 Das=
hboard is to provide a single reporting view that enables stakeholders to:<=
/p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"4dcb4060-652c-435e-9168-b1776b7c936b">
<li local-id=3D"9ec7ed55-4eb0-4493-9cf3-9505fce0637d">
<p local-id=3D"e7104d946bdd">Monitor the performance and coverage of the mi=
tigation policy/template.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"da1362dc-f4ca-445f-8378-2cb890943ddd">
<p local-id=3D"69fa60e1e3a2">Track Green, Amber, and Red bot decisions.</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"6affc206-b2e8-46e8-bcc6-48e624da0ce3">
<p local-id=3D"b085bc4733c8">Identify cases where the bot could not determi=
ne or locate mitigation.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"deeaed61-a4f4-479d-aff4-97590f048f52">
<p local-id=3D"67c7c2905d85">Track agent amendments to generated letter tem=
plates.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"51da93fa-1d16-4f62-bb87-5f7b5d56578b">
<p local-id=3D"a8189cd3b9bd">Monitor custom mitigations entered by agents.<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5eec9452-e278-486b-9021-851718c9e1b1">
<p local-id=3D"fa38873b17b5">Support template governance by identifying mis=
sing mitigation patterns.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1644624d-817f-412b-aa26-01079ea0b739">
<p local-id=3D"e44c4e0fde36">Provide operational transparency by agent, PCN=
 number, contravention code, and decision status.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bdd0d8c3-ac0c-4f1c-a7a2-0519850c3626">
<p local-id=3D"25289c4640a9">Enable the business to improve policy/template=
 coverage over time.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"4a72a4ea6443" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-4.Scope">4. Scope</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"2ad2d288bb19" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-4.1InScope">4.1 In Scope</h3>
<p local-id=3D"3c116b877603">The dashboard will include reporting for:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"bcba1fe0-3efe-4e57-9066-ac30e083999b">
<li local-id=3D"39a7e074-5d99-4458-b4c6-a3be9183ab35">
<p local-id=3D"171e96adc130">Summarisation Stage 3.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9e57b040-bec5-478c-9ddd-1d15b7c32b2d">
<p local-id=3D"8e249a5a4c87">Summarisation Stage 5.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e632afa0-25b6-49e2-8a48-9c97393fced0">
<p local-id=3D"a38bfa2ae234">Agent- level reporting.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"66258491-0221-4753-919e-a25403e138a8">
<p local-id=3D"5ca514263903">PCN- level reporting.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4d59bc90-6e56-4ffe-b047-695b27b579ba">
<p local-id=3D"94bc9c754883">Bot decision reporting using Green, Amber, and=
 Red classifications.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aa6bd9b1-a697-4abe-ad49-af1cdb69c8e4">
<p local-id=3D"c5d34c8d2874">Mitigation identified vs missing from policy/t=
emplate.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9368591a-db2d-4b02-ba3a-15fa4a40946a">
