<h2 local-id=3D"de9d84338335" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-11.BusinessRules">11. Business Rules</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1603" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"07ff6ba7-799e-4ab3-a9e3-b91177bbd59b" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 140.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 1462.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1cc0dc38-20b3-45b3-bc66-92c57543d0e8">
<th data-local-id=3D"d7580895-249a-43e6-abf5-ff264830efae" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f8e0d50aac72">Rule ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"83ce8ba9-7164-4687-8941-4c894764742f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"001df8c6d562">Business Rule</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6778dd92-ce6b-4415-b65d-dca721344eeb">
<td data-local-id=3D"238bc9a5-93d0-4598-9675-6c569efb0d4a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8031424ef5fb">BRULE- 01</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b36ccb04-f772-4460-a03c-672da3095dbe" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b139f91d94e5">Each reviewed Stage 3 or Stage 5 case should c=
reate or update a dashboard record.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5a581dff-b2e3-45d0-8633-9b6ffbee01a3">
<td data-local-id=3D"70e7d8ea-4fa6-49f9-b49d-120cf1375169" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5b7e73612543">BRULE- 02</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2abc3823-f40f-4dca-a0b3-dcf1ee5d7185" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e10819954a99">A case should be counted as =E2=80=9CMitigatio=
n Identified=E2=80=9D when the mitigation is matched to the configured poli=
cy/template.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"306e6be8-3341-4b65-bbd1-fbdd4f4a7b6c">
<td data-local-id=3D"ba14d453-0556-4e47-8d0c-14425c91a733" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2449322ba72d">BRULE- 03</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6d58051e-a15e-4b11-bec8-870f465075c3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ab1d4c17e2de">A case should be counted as =E2=80=9CMitigatio=
n Missing=E2=80=9D when the mitigation is not found in the configured polic=
y/template.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b9b0f697-f522-4ef4-9c42-098ccef0a326">
<td data-local-id=3D"d7d412fd-bb26-49c5-b28b-e477b0542e2e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ae3dea7046fc">BRULE- 04</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0bf065f6-1897-4308-98ff-8782bcc8022b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"42efd254dcc7">Bot decision colour should be captured as Gree=
n, Amber, or Red.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"72cb481c-f19b-4ceb-96d1-03cda96f98cd">
<td data-local-id=3D"99de3706-6fee-411b-b804-22e274450d44" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"36fb0b66a7ca">BRULE- 05</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"37c93a76-dedf-436e-a0e8-03661fa5d206" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fac95d60392b">Amber reason should be mandatory when bot deci=
sion colour is Amber.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"714c85f0-d1a6-431f-8572-f789f6dca5c2">
<td data-local-id=3D"b4620ff9-8ffe-45e9-9ff0-4931fb67ed20" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e24031501b17">BRULE- 06</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5c8405e4-6ee9-422f-9011-dad207344d5b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"13eeb8ab69f2">Letter amendment status should be captured as =
amended or not amended.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4bb0e20b-01cc-4e27-b4cf-707a27ed03f7">
<td data-local-id=3D"27db3068-354d-4071-a359-10efdebb6443" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"27c8090313ef">BRULE- 07</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4ef048d3-8c2b-4324-9737-d555aa47b46a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e86573ef23d9">Custom mitigation input should be captured whe=
never an agent enters a mitigation not available in the configured template=
.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"52740314-239a-4c64-b49b-1230654d1358">
<td data-local-id=3D"c784a114-c1f4-42c8-bcb6-7759c783c485" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fe5309e5adc5">BRULE- 08</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8b49c952-ec20-43ad-ba63-4a2a06b59c4c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a408c8fb6274">Custom mitigation records should be available =
for business review and template governance.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d70b3443-240a-409b-a5bc-35b5c1b7dfb2">
<td data-local-id=3D"e3064af4-8de6-421a-a158-a9ffbe036598" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8b4561c55d18">BRULE- 09</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5ed7067d-b5a0-47dc-92c7-154928541df7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dcc66890f7c8">PCN number should be retained in the dashboard=
 for case traceability.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1ee4b2c2-ce69-4da6-8b46-9262387ccc2c">
<td data-local-id=3D"a4fdcd13-5e89-4522-a284-ed3e34e27e52" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"661d0a9206dd">BRULE- 10</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"97672d10-589c-4e35-894b-2b6da49ba09a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"32bb4ba16bc1">Contravention code should be captured for tren=
d analysis.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"bc355272fd3f" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-12.ReportingandGovernanceUseCases">12. Reporting and Governance Use Ca=
ses</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"85c88e1f8460" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-12.1TemplateCoverageReview">12.1 Template Coverage Review</h3>
<p local-id=3D"db5a5966f628">Business users should be able to identify how =
many cases were successfully matched to policy/template versus how many wer=
e missing mitigation coverage.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"eefb10d05f6d" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-12.2AmberReasonAnalysis">12.2 Amber Reason Analysis</h3>
<p local-id=3D"558a9941b1d9">Business and operational users should be able =
to review Amber reasons to understand why cases require agent intervention.=
</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"6f0fcd7af40e" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-12.3RedCaseMonitoring">12.3 Red Case Monitoring</h3>
<p local-id=3D"9876a0d7f5c5">Business users should be able to monitor Red c=
ases to identify gaps in template coverage or bot interpretation.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"8e9a43906679" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-12.4LetterQualityMonitoring">12.4 Letter Quality Monitoring</h3>
<p local-id=3D"4f0d2b6dba5a">Operations and QA users should be able to trac=
k how often generated letters require agent amendment.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"a1a629984569" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-12.5CustomMitigationGovernance">12.5 Custom Mitigation Governance</h3>
<p local-id=3D"575d8c794853">Nat/Zain=E2=80=99s team should be able to revi=
ew custom mitigations and decide whether new mitigation entries should be a=
dded to the configurable policy/template.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"3fc7165b115d" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-13.Non-FunctionalRequirements">13. Non- Functional Requirements</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
