<td data-local-id=3D"3b043ac0-abcb-46db-9f77-6c155e662d57" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"235761ba4774">Dashboard should comply with GDPR and internal=
 data handling rules.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c97b4239-2368-4491-9914-2009cd4097c2">
<td data-local-id=3D"50214a57-34e6-4e68-a9a2-298742a5a22f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"96bcc70db818">Auditability</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"30e4cf33-7ffe-495f-b591-72ea02f75547" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"60e3c5776abd">Dashboard data should be traceable back to the=
 originating Stage 3 or Stage 5 case record where permitted.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4cb7ac85-8bb8-47fd-bc84-2b40026570f9">
<td data-local-id=3D"737881b2-ab8b-442f-a1d8-eefdc04ad8d5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"680eda0593ac">Scalability</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"97ec1aa2-84b7-4ea4-99ff-1a62c9099d1f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d3395268f0d0">Dashboard should support increasing case volum=
es as Stage 3 and Stage 5 usage expands.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a377a818-1041-4cb3-893f-d9bd23b32f05">
<td data-local-id=3D"f6b3ee05-abdf-4bd4-9ab3-8467fa3e2625" class=3D"conflue=
