nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ea1fd6ba3d6">Letter amendment status will be captured by th=
e Stage 3/Stage 5 workflow.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"23fb8916-3456-4a95-aaba-374835bfaddc">
<td data-local-id=3D"7283ede6-0ea7-4d2c-9a3e-8cf09dccbe94" class=3D"conflue=
