<h2 local-id=3D"28916aba81a1" id=3D"SummarisationStage03&amp;05DashboardBRD=
V1.0-18.SuccessCriteria">18. Success Criteria</h2>
<p local-id=3D"2987fe21e5e4">The dashboard will be considered successful if=
:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6c49fb8f-9209-4d33-9045-6e5bb9da0c25">
<li local-id=3D"dd59ac02-e79c-475e-90cd-5b3e8ef1984b">
<p local-id=3D"e99e57d0aeb1">Stage 3 and Stage 5 cases are visible in the d=
ashboard.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7552b00c-2f1d-4ee9-8fe5-6caa9b82d068">
<p local-id=3D"5e9492f08769">Business users can see total reviewed cases.</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0b008339-cfd9-4395-b02d-ef444a2840a3">
<p local-id=3D"5189a72e226d">Business users can distinguish mitigation iden=
tified vs mitigation missing cases.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cae6268d-04bf-47a9-96cd-461846bd3e0e">
<p local-id=3D"c3dfc1805395">Business users can monitor Green, Amber, and R=
ed bot decisions.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1da18dda-7027-4b2b-b2ce-3f82b78fc6b5">
<p local-id=3D"c99aa03a4fc5">Amber reasons are visible and reportable.</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"6158bf39-5979-4ac1-ae2f-983d7bf6bdc4">
<p local-id=3D"df4ff7d5def7">Letter amendment activity is visible.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"75c84c6f-78c1-423b-b3f7-9bbd305a68eb">
<p local-id=3D"98065c290ee5">Custom mitigation inputs are captured and revi=
ewable.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5966b04d-0804-4b61-8776-4ee005ed1aaf">
<p local-id=3D"9ae841adfa75">Agent name, PCN number, and contravention code=
 are available for traceability.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ab260766-c199-4102-83cc-2e4d1c6af7c8">
<p local-id=3D"b3380963147a">Dashboard is available within Notice IQ under =
Summarisation Organisation.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ea8d699b6bf0"></p>
<p>Sync Block</p>
